    "text": "Wirasat ka haq waqt guzarne se khatam nahi hota! ⚖️\nExpress Tribune ke mutabiq Supreme Court ne Friday ko faisla diya ke jaidad ke maalik ki wafat hote hi waris ka wirasat ka haq shuru ho jata hai, aur yeh haq waqt guzarne se khatam nahi hota. Paanch judges ke bench ka yeh faisla Justice Shahid Waheed ne likha. Court ne kaha ke jaidad ka intiqal karne se pehle NADRA ka Family Registration Certificate liya jaye, aur har waris ko, khawateen samait, un ke apne pate par likhit notice diya jaye.\nKya is faisle se khawateen ko wirasat mein un ka haq milega? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #SupremeCourt #Inheritance #WomenRights #PakistanNews",
